            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne nimuba nimushikhaya okhumbulila, kata khulwa ako kosi ta, ne nimuchenda nimufukulanga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kho ndalachenda nimufukulanga nobululu; khandi ndalamukuuma okhuula musaafu khulwa ebionoono bieenywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulalia inyama yemibili chiabaana beenywe abasiani, kata inyama yemibili chiabaana beenywe abakhaana mulachilia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndalamulula habundu weenywe hachinguukhu hosi, nirema ebimalilo bieenywe biamaleesi kelibuuliesi, nifuuba emilambo chieenywe khubirundu biemindu echia mwinamilanga; ne mulasinya omwoyo kwanje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndalakwisia amataala keenywe amakunda, nimulula habundu weenywe ahatakatifu hosi, kata shindalahulila eshiuya shieenywe eshilayi shiosi ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndalakwisia eshialo likunda; abasuku beenywe abamenyangamwo balachenya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neenyu, ndalamusalaasia mumahanga, ninzomola olukanga munyuma weenywe; eshialo shieenywe shilakwa obusasishi, namataala keenywe amakunda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habwenaho eshialo shilasangaalila tsisabato tsiashio, tsindaalo tsiosi olwa shibeetsanga mubusasishi, inywe nimuli mushialo shiabasuku; mundaalo etsio eshialo shilahuluukha, nishisangalila tsisabato tsiashio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olwa shiba nishishili mubusasishi shilahuluukhanga; ne nibwo obuhuluushi obwa shibulile musabato tsieenywe, olwa mwali nimwamenya khushio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne abo abakhaba nibasikaale khwinywe, ndalabaleerela obuyengukhu bwomwoyo ewa bali mubiali biabasuku babwe; kata okhusakasia khwelisaafu elichingwa nomuyeka khulabeelusia; baleelukha shinga owilikha olukanga; balakwa kata omundu yesi narabalondachilila ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baleesichiralanakhwo shinga abeebera olukanga, kata omundu yesi narabalondachililila ta; shimulabakhwo nobunyali olenwema Imbeli wabasuku oeenywe ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulasishila hakari wamahanga; eshialo shiabasuku beenywe shilamumila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo abakhaba nibasikaale khwinywe balahweelelela khulwa obumayaanu bwabwe, mubialo biabasuku beenywe; khandi khulwa obumayaanu bwabakuuka babwe balahweelelela shinga bo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baleeyama obumayaanu bwabwe, nobumayaanu bwabakuuka babwe, mubukhayi bwabwe obwa bakhaya, khandi mbu okhuba injenda yabwe yafukulanga; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "niko akachila siesi ndachenda nimbafukulanga, nimbaleera mushialo shiabasuku babwe; kho habwenaho emioyo chiabwe echibula eshishebo nichiba nobwongoli, nabo nibafuchiilila obukuumwi bwobumayaanu bwabwe; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kho ndaleetsulila indakano yanje naYakobo; khandi nende indakano yanje naIsaka, na indakano yanje naAburahamu ndalatsiitsulila; ne ndaleetsulila eshialo eshio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne balalekha eshialo tsana; shilasangaalila tsisabato tsiashio, olwa shiba nishikona mubusasishi nibabulaho; nabo balafuchiilila obukuumwi bwobumayaanu bwabwe; shichila baloba obukhalachi bwanje, khandi aka ndalachilisia nikasinya emioyo chiabwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebutswa olwa balaba nibali mushialo shiabasuku babwe, isie shindalabaloba, kata shibalasinya, mbu embatibilie elala kata okhwonoonia indakano yanje ninabo, ta; okhuba nisie OMWAMI Nyasaye wabwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne khulwabwe ndaleetsulila indakano yabakuuka babwe aba ndarusia mushibala shiaMisiri amahanga nikalola, mbu embe Nyasaye wabwe; isie nisie OMWAMI.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.45"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
